# USE: [filter_remote] with force-policy=<policy>.
# Coverage includes mainland China and overseas AI services in ONE policy-less set.
# Put specific per-service overrides before this set, then general Google/Microsoft/GitHub/Meta/Apple sets.
# Existing 476 conditions are preserved. New shared cloud roots, broad ASNs and generic telemetry are excluded.
# Domain data and static format verification do not establish service availability or device acceptance.
#
# The following MIT notice applies to adapted third-party source data.
